{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17156","headline":"奉和圣制九月十八日赐百寮追赏因书所怀 · 权德舆","name":"奉和圣制九月十八日赐百寮追赏因书所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锡宴朝野洽，追欢尧舜情。\n秋堂丝管动，水榭烟霞生。\n黄花媚新霁，碧树含余清。\n同和六律应，交泰万宇平。\n春藻下中天，湛恩阐文明。\n小臣谅何以，亦此彯华缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}